{
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_DEFECT.0-0r.char": "I am angry at the architect",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_DEFECT.0-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_DEFECT.0-1r.ancient": "You die",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_DEFECT.0-attack": "BOTH",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "New cloak, huh? Snazzy! Here, take your gift. You know Darv's gotcha!",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "Thank",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_introduction",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.char": "Thank you, Lord Darv. Your generosity is always appreciated.",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient": "Heh heh... uh... yeah. Of course. Any time.",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.next": "Continue",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_endeared",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.ancient": "(THAT'S what she sounds like!?)",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_fear",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "You're the chatty one, aren't ya? I'm startin' to learn how to tell you apart!",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_introduction",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.char": "Do you have any toxins in your collection? I need to find something stronger.",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "Continue",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient": "I can hook ya up! Are the baddies buildin' a tolerance out there?",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "Correct",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/darv/darv_endeared",
  "DARV.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.char": "Oh, no. It's not for them.",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.char": "Strange to see the Spire devoid of our Serpent's haze.\nI must set this right.",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.ancient": "[sine]...ascend.. ..find [red]Architect[/red]... ..[jitter]KILL[/jitter]...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "Refuse",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/neow/neow_welcome",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.char": "No. I need him to see through clouded eyes once again.",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.ancient": "[sine]...close... ...enough...[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/neow/neow_curious",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.char": "My Serpent... I must bring this world into your coil.",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.char": "This lucidity will be the death of me.",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "Continue",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient": "[sine]...hair.. ..of the dog...?[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "Turn down",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/neow/neow_welcome",
  "NEOW.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.char": "Your world has no venom potent enough.\nAnd I've tried most of them...",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "You aren't the same as Neow's other puppet, are you?",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "Confirm",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_welcome",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.char": "I respect Lady Neow, but I serve the Serpent. Not her.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient": "And you speak! Isn't that interesting?",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_giggle",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "Does breaking your vow dull your killer's edge?\nWe'll just have to find out, won't we?",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_welcome",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient": "I was always curious about her. Your counterpart.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "Disappoint",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_welcome",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.char": "I would have no insight into her mind.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.char": "Insight is folly, and a deadlier poison than any traced along a blade.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.next": "Continue",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-3.ancient": "You try so very hard to hide from yourself.\nI wonder what you're afraid to find.",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-3.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/nonupeipe/nonupeipe_grossed_out",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "No Blight? You're cured!! Hooray!!!",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "Question",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.char": "'Blight...?' Oh! This confusion is welcome.",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient": "And talk now! Not know Blight do that!!",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "You talking one??\nTell me about snake friend! Tell me! Tell me!!",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.char": "Orobas. You must see many things through that great eye of yours.",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "Continue",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient": "Wow! Yes! So much!!",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "Prod",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.char": "Does it ever burden you? Experiencing such endless clarity?",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.next": "Continue",
  "OROBAS.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-3.ancient": "No! Never! See so much stuff!! Love see stuff!!!",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.char": "Lord Pael! I've been carrying a dose of your usual tincture, lest you be troubled by dreams undisturbed.",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "Continue",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.ancient": "[thinky_dots]...zzzzZZZZzzzz...[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "Leave it for him",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.char": "Of course. Allow me to leave it here, then.",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.char": "He slumbers so peacefully. Perhaps I don't miss his restless turning...",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient": "[thinky_dots]That concoction... what did you give me...?[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "Explain",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.char": "A mixture of hemlock and the venom of the local Snecko.\nIs it not to your liking?",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "PAEL.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.ancient": "[thinky_dots]My dreams... such frightening shapes... what are you...?[/thinky_dots]",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "HUNTRESS! THERE YOU ARE! I LOST YOU BEFORE WE COULD FIGHT!!",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "Redirect",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.char": "I'm afraid you've mistaken me for someone else.",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient": "WHY ARE YOU TALKING!? THAT'S SCARY!!!",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "SO MANY DAGGERS! DO ENOUGH DAGGERS BECOME MIGHTY??",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient": "FIGHT ME, ACOLYTE!",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "Preach",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.char": "[i][font_size=22]The Acolyte instead shares a selection from her religious texts.[/font_size][/i]",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.ancient": "NO MORE! I YIELD!!",
  "TANX.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.ancient.sfx": "event:/sfx/npcs/tanx/tanx_roar",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "[jitter][b]You...[/b][/jitter]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "Continue",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.ancient": "You aren't like that other one. I can tell.",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "Acknowledge",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.char": "The Serpent teaches we are all unalike. And yet, we are one.",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.next": "Continue",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.ancient": "Oh, no, you aren't like her at all!\nAnd yet, perhaps you are. More than you would know...",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "Poor thing. You have nowhere left to [jitter][b]belong[/b][/jitter].",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.char": "Lady Tezcatara... may I admit that you alone are unfamilliar to me?",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "Continue",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.ancient": "Knowing what I know about your Serpent, dearie...\nMaybe I'm the only rat with enough sense to flee a sinking ship.",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.ancient": "[i][font_size=22]Tezcatara cackles darkly enough to give even the Acolyte pause.[/font_size][/i]",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.char": "You must abandon your anger, Architect!",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.char": "Join me and share the Serpent’s embrace.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.ancient": "Aren't you supposed to be quiet?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.next": "Explain",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.char": "Not while I am compelled to guide the lost.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-3.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-4.ancient": "Then I will compel you to silence.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-attack": "Architect",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.char": "The Serpent shall uplift all creatures of this Spire. Even you.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-1r.ancient": "I am the only god this place requires.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-attack": "Architect",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0r.char": "Sending me back is futile. The fog will fall and all will join us.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1r.ancient": "Being stabbed was preferable to your preaching.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-attack": "Architect",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.3-0r.char": "I come to you with a message—",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.3-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.3-1r.ancient": "Enough! I’m not listening to any more of your drivel!",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.3-attack": "Architect",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.ancient": "The others mistook you for [i]her[/i], didn't they? But I know better.",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-0.next": "Continue",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.ancient": "That thing really did a number on you. Almost gives [i]me[/i] the creeps.",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-1.next": "Continue",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.0-2.char": "The Serpent lifted us all up. I have no need to rise to your provocation.",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.1-0r.ancient": "Don't worry. Where your soul's been? I wouldn't touch it.",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.ancient": "So how did it go down? In your world, I mean.",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-0.next": "Answer",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.char": "Do not be afraid, Vakuu. You'll see for yourself soon enough.",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-1.next": "Continue",
  "VAKUU.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_SILENT.2-2.ancient": "Not gonna spill, huh? Can't blame a guy for trying to protect his business.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_NECROBINDER.0-0r.char": "I am angry at the architect",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_NECROBINDER.0-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_NECROBINDER.0-1r.ancient": "You die",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_NECROBINDER.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-0r.ancient": "What are you supposed to be?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-0r.next": "Threaten",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-1r.char": "Come at me...\nKnave...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-1r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-2r.ancient": "Ah. Of course. Another one.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-0r.ancient": "Back for more?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-0r.next": "Threaten",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-1r.char": "I shall end thee...",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-1r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-2r.ancient": "What a waste you are.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.1-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-0r.ancient": "This persistence isn't admirable. It's just sad.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-0r.next": "Threaten",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-1r.char": "I will climb as many times as I must... until I bring thy death.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-1r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-2r.ancient": "Let the earth claim you. It's the only way your misery ends.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_IRONCLAD.2-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-0.char": "Ahoy! Say, some of this junk looks pretty valuable.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-0.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-1.ancient": "Lovely. Another pain in my side.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-1.next": "Respond",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-2.char": "You think I'm a pain? Well, I'm about to be!",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.0-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-0r.char": "Guess who's back! Did you miss me?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-1r.ancient": "It seems I did.",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-1r.next": "Respond",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-2r.char": "Aww. I missed you too! Wait, what's that light?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.1-attack": "Both",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.2-0r.char": "Have you thought about putting in an elevator?",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.2-0r.next": "Continue",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.INTOTHESPIREVERSE-SHADOW_REGENT.2-1r.ancient": "Have you considered leaving me be?",
